{"id":49891,"date":"2026-03-10T18:17:40","date_gmt":"2026-03-10T17:17:40","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=49891"},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:49:08","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:49:08","slug":"crp-resistencia-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/crp-resistencia-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"1\u00ba CRP Ribafria Resist\u00eancia Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">1\u00ba CRP Ribafria Resist\u00eancia Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>1\u00ba CRP Ribafria Resist\u00eancia Trail 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>31 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida \u00e0s <strong>14:00<\/strong> na zona verde da <strong>Fonte da Senhora<\/strong>, na vila da Benedita, concelho de <strong>Alcoba\u00e7a<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. Organizado pelo <strong>Centro Recreativo e Popular de Ribafria (CRP Ribafria)<\/strong>, este desafio pedestre inaugura um eletrizante formato de resist\u00eancia na regi\u00e3o oeste.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com a dura\u00e7\u00e3o limite de <strong>3 horas<\/strong> num circuito fechado de aproximadamente <strong>3,5 km por volta<\/strong>, os atletas podem competir a t\u00edtulo <strong>Individual<\/strong> ou em <strong>Duplas<\/strong> (Masculinas, Femininas e Mistas em regime de estafeta). O evento disp\u00f5e de apoio log\u00edstico integral, abastecimentos na zona de transi\u00e7\u00e3o, balne\u00e1rios com banhos quentes no Pavilh\u00e3o do CRP Ribafria e conv\u00edvio gastron\u00f3mico final na sede da coletividade.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">31 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 14:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-